# RT-qPCR parent workflow — containment test

```asterlab
kind: experiment
id: exp-rtqpcr
schema: 1
title: RT-qPCR parent workflow
objective: Test whether a parent workflow can contain a reusable RNA extraction block.
experimental_unit: sample
primary_endpoint: Relative expression
endpoint_method: RT-qPCR
endpoint_unit: fold change
sample_size_rationale: Four virtual samples; UI validation only.
planned_run_count: 1
planned_run_relationship: independent
```

```asterlab
kind: group
id: g-rtqpcr
schema: 1
name: RT-qPCR
role: control
condition: RNA extraction block reused from the PureLink protocol block
independent_n: 4
technical_repeats: 1
```

```asterlab
kind: assay
id: assay-rtqpcr
schema: 1
title: RT-qPCR
endpoint: Relative expression
method: RT-qPCR
unit: fold change
group_refs: [g-rtqpcr]
protocol_version_id: 2066e8ba-17c9-48be-976a-64e4ddde64a6
```

```asterlab
kind: reference
id: ref-rna-block
schema: 1
ref: c23df8e1-3f2a-4449-8ac9-a4bb7256a113
view: protocol_block
```

```asterlab
kind: sample
id: rt-s01
schema: 1
sample_id: RNA-S01
group_ref: g-rtqpcr
amount: {value: 1, unit: mL}
```

```asterlab
kind: sample
id: rt-s02
schema: 1
sample_id: RNA-S02
group_ref: g-rtqpcr
amount: {value: 1, unit: mL}
```

```asterlab
kind: sample
id: rt-s03
schema: 1
sample_id: RNA-S03
group_ref: g-rtqpcr
amount: {value: 1, unit: mL}
```

```asterlab
kind: sample
id: rt-s04
schema: 1
sample_id: RNA-S04
group_ref: g-rtqpcr
amount: {value: 1, unit: mL}
```

```asterlab
kind: step
id: step-rna-extract
schema: 2
title: 01 RNA 提取
assay: assay-rtqpcr
path: rtqpcr/rna-extraction
order: 1
uses:
  - {ref: ref-rna-block, role: other}
  - {ref: rt-s01, role: sample}
  - {ref: rt-s02, role: sample}
  - {ref: rt-s03, role: sample}
  - {ref: rt-s04, role: sample}
tasks:
  - {id: extract, title: "复用 PureLink RNA 提取块（10 步）", kind: procedure}
checks:
  - {checkId: rna-extract-complete, title: RNA 提取子流程完成, blocking: true}
```

```asterlab
kind: step
id: step-rna-qc
schema: 2
title: 02 RNA 质控
assay: assay-rtqpcr
path: rtqpcr/rna-qc
order: 2
uses:
  - {ref: rt-s01, role: sample}
  - {ref: rt-s02, role: sample}
  - {ref: rt-s03, role: sample}
  - {ref: rt-s04, role: sample}
tasks:
  - {id: qc, title: "记录 RNA 浓度与 A260/A280", kind: measurement, readout: rna_qc}
checks:
  - {checkId: qc-pass, title: RNA 浓度与 A260/A280 已记录, blocking: true}
```

```asterlab
kind: step
id: step-rt
schema: 2
title: 03 逆转录
assay: assay-rtqpcr
path: rtqpcr/rt
order: 3
uses:
  - {ref: rt-s01, role: sample}
  - {ref: rt-s02, role: sample}
  - {ref: rt-s03, role: sample}
  - {ref: rt-s04, role: sample}
tasks:
  - {id: rt, title: "RNA -> cDNA", kind: procedure}
checks:
  - {checkId: rt-complete, title: cDNA 合成完成, blocking: true}
```

```asterlab
kind: step
id: step-qpcr
schema: 2
title: 04 qPCR 扩增及检测
assay: assay-rtqpcr
path: rtqpcr/qpcr
order: 4
uses:
  - {ref: rt-s01, role: sample}
  - {ref: rt-s02, role: sample}
  - {ref: rt-s03, role: sample}
  - {ref: rt-s04, role: sample}
tasks:
  - {id: qpcr, title: "配置反应并运行 qPCR", kind: measurement, readout: ct}
checks:
  - {checkId: qpcr-complete, title: 扩增曲线与 Ct 已记录, blocking: true}
```

```asterlab
kind: workflow
id: wf-rtqpcr
schema: 1
steps: [step-rna-extract, step-rna-qc, step-rt, step-qpcr]
edges:
  - {from: step-rna-extract, to: step-rna-qc}
  - {from: step-rna-qc, to: step-rt}
  - {from: step-rt, to: step-qpcr}
business_order: [step-rna-extract, step-rna-qc, step-rt, step-qpcr]
```
